        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) The skills of all incumbent CST's and SCST's (excluding Employees whose sole system skill qualification is in a Declining System) will be reviewed annually to ensure continued proficiency in their assigned system and level. If an Employee is identified as having a skill deficiency caused by changes in technology or other skill-related deficiencies, a recertification plan (including applicable training, on-the-job assignments, etc.) will be established. Periodic reviews will be conducted during the next twelve (12) months to assist the Employee to correct the deficiencies. If the deficiencies are not corrected, the Employee's next applicable negotiated wage increase, per Paragraph 1 above, will be withheld. Once the deficiencies are corrected, the Employee's negotiated wage increase will be restored.",
            "block_bbox": [
                377,
                119,
                877,
                346
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
